# Cloudflare Pages SPA routing note
# ---------------------------------
# Do NOT use a Netlify-style catch-all here:
#   /*    /index.html   200
# On Pages, _redirects proxy rules are always applied even when a matching
# static file exists, which can shadow crawl assets like /llms.txt.
#
# Built-in SPA mode (no top-level 404.html) already serves index.html for
# unmatched client routes while leaving real files in `dist/` alone:
#   public/llms.txt
#   public/.well-known/security.txt
#   public/robots.txt
#   public/sitemap.xml
#
# Functions stay scoped via public/_routes.json (include: /api/*, /pay/* only).
